usage: analyze_d9.py [-h]
                     (--package PACKAGE | --portable-input PORTABLE_INPUT)
                     [--portable-manifest PORTABLE_MANIFEST]
                     [--portable-manifest-sha PORTABLE_MANIFEST_SHA]
                     [--ledger LEDGER] [--ledger-index LEDGER_INDEX] [--d8 D8]
                     [--contract CONTRACT] --out OUT

